# ---- Runtime state the bot writes ----
# These normally live under DATA_ROOT, outside the repo. But DATA_DIR can be
# pointed anywhere, and a stray run inside the working tree would otherwise
# commit live operating state to a PUBLIC repository: open positions, kill
# state, reconciliation reports. Cheap insurance against an expensive slip.
killed_state
heartbeat
KILL_SWITCH
RESET_DRAWDOWN
orchestrator_mode.txt
daily_risk_state.json
position_state.json
reconciliation_latest.json
overnight_risk_latest.json
